{"id":"f018bd7f-221b-4a54-82aa-f061dc7e6ee6","content":" You MUST activate the relevant skill whenever you work in that domain\u2014don't wait until you're stuck.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- You must follow all existing code conventions used in this application. When creating or editing a file, check sibling files for the correct structure, approach, and naming.\n- Use descriptive names for variables and methods. For example, `isRegisteredForDiscounts`, not `discount()`.\n- Check for existing components to reuse before writing a new one.\n\n## Verification Scripts\n\n- Do not create verification scripts or tinker when tests cover that functionality and prove they work. Unit and feature tests are more important.\n\n## Application Structure & Architecture\n\n- Stick to existing directory structure; don't create new base folders without approval.\n- Do not change the application's dependencies without approval","embedding":[-0.0042787036,0.02347493,0.0128678605,-0.011057714,-0.0016876077,0.002448596,-0.0008664089,-0.015924934,0.0064526703,-0.040313847,-0.03215906,0.0035372667,0.025948534,-0.0013569639,0.012270257,-0.021986786,0.007531723,-0.014201934,-0.031579625,0.0023618164,-0.009968224,-0.010061678,0.0047147647,0.035951927,-0.007872221,0.013410292,-0.009921573,-0.048480842,-0.01736982,0.13187385,-0.013853314,-0.011333847,0.014823829,-0.01443201,0.005835021,-0.010498705,-0.0016013854,0.011633917,-0.012849905,0.00590077,-0.005542581,0.0009464431,-0.0028809004,-0.026239714,0.0040253336,-0.014839595,-0.0071798465,0.008133166,0.005734456,-0.0050965305,0.016391026,0.01622512,0.0029884398,-0.012560242,0.0014142665,0.0038359228,0.017841728,0.020803157,0.023307174,0.0037283672,0.004242904,-0.0045162886,0.037325133,0.007589041,0.008212148,-0.01593802,0.028311385,-0.0028892653,-0.00019656532,0.009127614,0.01105598,0.0115249,-0.018632684,0.033828266,-0.009999286,-0.020470759,-0.040972453,0.006706483,-0.009518561,0.041428994,0.00397153,-0.017460626,-0.01972943,-0.019732883,-0.0223959