{"id":"38092ba0-d2d2-46ed-a9f3-edec6f5cdded","content":"** `Grid`, `Section`, `Fieldset`, and `Repeater` do not span all columns by default.\n- **Use `Select::make('author_id')->relationship('author', 'name')` for BelongsTo fields.** `BelongsToSelect` does not exist in v4.\n- **`Repeater` uses `->schema()`, not `->fields()`.**\n- **Never add `->dehydrated(false)` to fields that need to be saved.** It strips the value from form state before `->action()` or the save handler runs. Only use it for helper\/UI-only fields.\n- **Use correct property types when overriding `Page`, `Resource`, and `Widget` properties","embedding":[0.007497812,0.015265679,0.037744045,-0.036726795,-0.023475448,0.0019491237,0.0072803264,-0.012351405,0.0031382544,-0.055158086,-0.0070360703,0.0024064581,0.03607016,-0.021571519,0.022528082,0.0034996124,0.017297441,-0.03282711,-0.021354044,-0.0049350667,0.01655184,0.0015808715,0.0022536144,0.017556047,0.01214987,0.02630263,0.0064013116,-0.03853194,-0.021099072,0.120458424,0.0028729632,-0.02417378,-0.01930852,-0.018063044,0.0071965083,0.01489677,-0.0009410075,0.02702059,0.009828025,0.011201139,0.009659965,-0.0027689799,-0.00680693,-0.015996756,-0.0020641447,-0.013299118,-0.0330097,0.0095999725,-0.017718371,0.0043122554,0.011719167,0.009631549,0.011312814,-0.028843112,-0.026260851,0.008254329,-0.0069361725,-0.0072461916,0.020510593,0.0068859262,-0.026895218,-0.016943133,0.0093788635,0.0078455405,-0.0012553277,-0.015518973,0.0148625085,0.00624082,0.011237249,0.008948433,-0.010735407,0.032157864,-0.012387244,-0.005512852,-0.009937252,-0.014139513,-0.011862758,-0.012729834,0.008345312,0.011490231,-0.017825918,-0.005266541,-0.016956879,-0.010692286,0.0063039637,0.0075440872,1.4207022e-6,-0.00089430925,-0.0008689288,-0.0014513191,0.009087301,-0.0001829081,0.018384412,-0.026151365,-0.009363344,0.022033054,0.003003521,-0.018718714,0.004508067,0.006018548,-0.010069939,0.007860389,-0.022292359,0.005714604,-0.0054564583,-0.023442285,0.009843874,0.00969386,0.008