{"id":"c7c5e24b-98b9-4a23-9166-7ce23671e7d1","content":"Manuale operativo OAM \u2014 UnicoOAM\n \n\nManuale operativo OAM \u2014 UnicoOAM\n\nUnicoOAM \u00e8 l'applicativo con cui la societ\u00e0 di mediazione creditizia gestisce gli\nadempimenti previsti dall'iscrizione all'OAM (Organismo degli Agenti\ne dei Mediatori): tenuta del registro reclami, delle segnalazioni di operazioni\nsospette (SOS\/antiriciclaggio), degli audit periodici e la compilazione della\nrelazione semestrale da inviare all'OAM. I dati sulle pratiche di\nfinanziamento e sulle provvigioni non si inseriscono qui a mano: arrivano importati\ndal gestionale Proforma, che gira sullo stesso server MySQL ma su un database\nseparato, in sola lettura.\n\nIndice\n1. Accesso e ruoli\n2. Anagrafiche\n3. Import delle pratiche da Proforma\n4. Relazione semestrale OAM (M510)\n5. Audit interni e rilievi\n6. Registro reclami\n7. Segnalazioni operazioni sospette (SOS)\n8. Documenti e scadenzario\n9. Modelli email e plichi documentali\n10. Organismi di vigilanza e piani di rimedio\n11. Utenti, ruoli e permessi\n12. Assistente AI\n13","embedding":[0.002911776,0.02167338,-0.0038402686,0.011299569,0.008858098,0.012840912,0.00977046,0.007941299,0.008630367,-0.051668543,0.0011248598,0.026316874,0.0046957824,-0.0014138324,0.026905354,-0.020083532,-0.0035291081,-0.013289408,0.003842196,-0.021499224,-0.013384265,-0.0026118965,0.008313094,0.0051122745,-0.008295414,0.004261826,0.0075733257,-0.020140436,-0.031864822,0.13482061,0.011651858,-0.009981278,0.0050666193,-0.018167118,0.01294323,-0.008321939,-0.02719811,0.014064248,0.0050615384,-0.021027096,-0.011908893,-0.0044759414,0.008584155,0.007186639,0.00085543277,0.019065436,0.005500687,-0.0043040994,-0.00042833562,-0.0016393615,0.016219173,0.0070842877,-0.020172747,0.01686257,0.008022719,-0.004213373,0.0043896507,-0.00902159,0.014509192,0.0058048987,0.0042621647,-0.010556554,-0.0026306435,0.018492756,-0.012229452,-0.023461567,0.021160195,-0.010392572,0.013996046,0.00872206,