{"id":"d26c1478-a301-42d1-b2ab-a3d3e066ab7b","content":" Glossario\n\n1. Accesso e ruoli\n\nSi accede dal pannello all'indirizzo \/admin, con login Microsoft o\nGoogle (pulsanti \"Accedi con Microsoft\" \/ \"Accedi con Google\" nella pagina di\nlogin) oppure con email e password se l'account \u00e8 gi\u00e0 stato creato manualmente.\n\nOgni utente ha un ruolo (campo role sulla scheda\nutente) che determina cosa pu\u00f2 vedere, indipendentemente dal menu:\n\nRuoloCosa pu\u00f2 usare\n\nadmin \/ userTutte le funzionalit\u00e0 abilitate dal piano attivo.\n\ninspector (Ispettore)Solo Audit, Reclami, Segnalazioni SOS, Semestrale OAM e la scheda documenti dei fascicoli.\n\nquality (Qualit\u00e0)Solo Audit e la scheda documenti.\n\nsosRuolo riservato all'ambito antiriciclaggio.\n\nSe una voce di menu non compare, o si prova ad aprirne l'indirizzo direttamente e\nsi riceve un errore di autorizzazione, \u00e8 perch\u00e9 il ruolo o il piano attivo non\ncomprendono quella funzionalit\u00e0: non \u00e8 un guasto, va richiesto all'amministratore\ndi cambiare ruolo","embedding":[0.0036245242,0.024161741,0.029522553,-0.014761568,0.0015740206,0.00616348,0.023091936,0.0041029467,0.007433427,-0.06385207,-0.008415416,0.027754884,0.018607548,-0.013984965,0.018960912,-0.017545685,0.019406814,0.014640097,0.0048488863,-0.0012635624,-0.03206195,0.017440654,-0.00623825,0.013715885,-0.00944366,0.011705288,0.020015918,-0.010035581,-0.02936837,0.11819655,-0.0046189884,-0.008516546,0.0017544538,-0.014411006,0.0047258674,-7.978262e-5,-0.0025180825,0.012083189,0.007180548,-0.01564598,-0.00070924475,-0.0037502653,0.007623265,-0.003462298,0.0071151885,0.0078015625,-0.00042661998,0.0087111,0.021085812,0.013141068,0.029795231,0.016493678,-0.012316388,0.00238726,-0.004991757,0.004048657,-0.010520947,-0.009595798,0.028964903,0.007521834,0.0093102595,-0.008033087,0.0003773288,0.0072496473,-0.009623084,-0.007522144,0.0014913249,-0.009210347,0.015527216,-0.017743817,-0.008995572,0.044879057,0.015733603,