{"id":"cf42e295-9e7a-40bf-848a-e9496c9ce994","content":"\n\nSiti web\n\nDomini istituzionali o commerciali collegati alla societ\u00e0, con la data di\npubblicazione del foglio informativo\/trasparenza: alimenta il foglio\n\"Informativo\" della relazione semestrale.\n\nIstituti Eroganti e Produttori\n\n\"Istituti Eroganti\" \u00e8 l'anagrafica delle banche\/istituti finanziari mandanti\n(dati importati da Proforma, in sola lettura); \"Produttori\" \u00e8 l'anagrafica degli\nagenti\/collaboratori commerciali (anch'essa da Proforma). Da qui si verifica se\nun istituto \u00e8 convenzionato e si consultano eventuali blacklist.\n\nCodici OAM\n\nTabella di corrispondenza tra il tipo di prodotto gestito internamente (es.\n\"Mutuo\", \"Cessione del Quinto\") e la classificazione di prodotto creditizio\nrichiesta dall'OAM. Va mantenuta aggiornata: se manca la corrispondenza per un\nnuovo tipo di prodotto, l'importazione delle pratiche (\u00a73) non riesce a\nclassificarlo correttamente nella relazione","embedding":[0.0027034583,0.028370177,0.0017836555,-0.011330793,0.011610041,0.020344866,0.018960735,-0.0041495943,-0.016417483,-0.0596058,-0.012564621,0.0072791227,0.012451734,-0.012727198,0.012220482,-0.004948261,0.0064972932,-0.0024869347,0.01675999,-0.03503436,-0.004371693,0.0064629354,0.0073425462,0.008023357,-0.005434626,0.028175663,0.0020580152,-0.018435203,-0.022827527,0.09800527,0.005487593,-0.005670811,0.0077682356,-0.009354487,0.0045427927,0.0042877304,-0.012685168,-0.009285556,-0.006484314,-0.025127348,-0.018932689,-0.013674652,0.00011851616,0.0036532735,0.010060302,-0.005888766,-0.007434519,-0.008478819,0.0015027871,0.018370518,0.052169316,0.029124549,-0.008672597,0.010504483,0.012185468,0.01578251,-0.006198586,0.0029806995,0.024258232,0.009595549,0.005282212,-0.013892695,-0.009774041,0.0040824497,-0.0063690585,0.015775364,0.018107634,-0.0056995032,0.012695359,0.0036268437,-0.009350034,0.025830774,-0.002100392,0.018103406,-0.029870443,-0.003112028,-0.04472705,0.005