{"id":"db85d71a-1863-4aaf-9a9f-1e1c91193bdc","content":"\n\nOrganigramma (Collaboratori)\n\nAnagrafica dei dipendenti e collaboratori interni, con iscrizioni professionali\n(OAM, RUI\/IVASS), sede di appartenenza, responsabile diretto e ruoli\nprivacy\/GDPR. Da qui si assegna anche il tipo di collaboratore\nusato per calcolare i permessi granulari (\u00a711).\n\n3. Import delle pratiche da Proforma\n\nLe pratiche di finanziamento e le relative provvigioni sono gestite nel\ngestionale Proforma, su un database separato dello stesso\nserver MySQL, collegato in sola lettura: da UnicoOAM non si\ncrea n\u00e9 si modifica mai una pratica direttamente.\n\nPer portare i dati di un semestre dentro UnicoOAM si usa l'importazione,\ndisponibile in due modi:\n\nDal pannello: sezione \"Semestrale OAM\", pulsante\n\"Importa Pratiche\" nella pagina elenco. Importa sempre il\nsemestre corrente (quello in corso o appena chiuso, calcolato automaticamente\nin base alla data odierna)","embedding":[-0.0017126361,0.032515902,-0.0022259718,-0.0077963686,-0.006417546,-2.5414929e-5,0.019291453,-0.0027130465,-0.012312465,-0.051281538,-0.0022225191,0.035614964,-7.442227e-5,0.008474228,0.012883187,-0.015847692,-0.007034083,-0.013252396,0.0032109062,-0.036430836,-0.0034958625,-0.0013234975,0.008532883,0.022898883,-0.009818296,0.024647737,0.0066960896,-0.020917298,-0.031254135,0.100536406,0.008527903,-0.008231408,-0.00056726014,-0.030786844,-0.005400134,-0.0045784563,-0.034630504,0.005720373,0.0016976515,-0.009330367,-0.0048304354,-0.011399208,-0.011286233,-0.0011978096,0.0045062653,0.0009956344,-0.010334908,-0.016134595,0.01069873,0.0033398923,0.03237616,0.023158018,-0.03378737,0.009843745,0.007642067,0.026711227,-0.010925728,-0.01050403,0.04244944,0.012886985,0.0153934015,-0.011268723,-0.0024666626,0.008234157,-0.013910989,0.0026554228,0.018370498,-0.017469607,0.018327555,-0.003976742,-0.009768449,0.0151386,0.0076721916,0.010828279,-0.018050287,-0.00014308671,-0.04053482,0.014402123,0.0037362704