{"id":"bb2b6060-01bb-44f8-ad4b-a978d16da0ef","content":"\n\nDa riga di comando (per un tecnico): php artisan\noam:import-pratiche, con le opzioni --year= e\n--semester= (1 o 2) per forzare un periodo diverso da quello\ncorrente. \u00c8 anche schedulato automaticamente ogni luned\u00ec alle 03:00 per tenere\nallineati i dati di lavoro.\n\nAttenzione: lanciare l'importazione ricostruisce da\nzero i dati di lavoro del periodo interessato (tabella pratiche OAM e\nil relativo aggregato semestrale): eventuali correzioni manuali fatte su quel\nperiodo vengono sovrascritte. Non tocca invece gli altri periodi gi\u00e0 chiusi.\nSe un'importazione \u00e8 gi\u00e0 in corso, un tentativo concorrente viene rifiutato con\nun messaggio esplicito, non genera un doppio conteggio","embedding":[-0.004778453,0.019651253,-0.0015920035,0.0060327137,-0.0020277444,-0.007943092,-0.0020954234,-0.010507816,-0.017514357,-0.050880745,0.006128521,0.025332136,0.005207529,0.017564597,0.010963439,-0.00499759,0.011986423,-0.010235615,0.00461126,-0.029314991,-0.00095279363,0.0050060255,-0.0040088403,0.011392223,-0.0024759278,0.011181904,0.0005807729,-0.02400867,-0.025722468,0.12136595,0.009041073,0.0067775496,-0.002102075,-0.030586373,0.009738291,-0.00041518002,-0.02766409,0.016408201,0.021753646,-0.02222285,-0.010094377,-0.014218896,0.0010558655,0.0045313346,-0.008604704,0.0056204144,-0.009129333,0.007735673,0.013133649,-0.01989129,0.016275594,0.008753537,-0.012164444,0.025400905,0.002790882,0.020487912,-0.024704726,-0.023942523,0.0085955635,0.023235694,-0.006499338,-0.010026308,0.020954996,0.0132750645,-0.019729769,0.009003761,0.020981768,-0.030260492,0.0056370064,0.01226099,0.009262523,-0.0033197238,0.00037153042,-0.0044380543,-0.024095424,0.0072400286,-0.046927672,0.022904234,-0.02074041,0.010253392,-0.0192393,-0.009492721,-0.03237872,-0.007669085,0.009935888,0.004774667,-0.018479062,-0.0019759336,-0.0076900166,0.003744192,-0.009530579,-0.0029882104,0.0009899081,-0.016136173,-0.035165284,0.0253484