{"id":"9c7b3871-279f-47d6-a8ba-7aac4a271fd2","content":"\n\nDurante l'importazione il sistema, per ogni pratica del semestre:\n\nrecupera l'istituto erogante, il produttore\/agente e le provvigioni\n(cliente, istituto, premio, agente, eventuali storni) sommandole da Proforma;\n\ncalcola l'erogato lordo (0 se l'istituto non \u00e8 una banca convenzionata,\naltrimenti l'importo netto o l'importo lordo a seconda del tipo di prodotto);\n\nclassifica il prodotto creditizio tramite i Codici OAM (\u00a72) e distingue le\npratiche gi\u00e0 erogate da quelle ancora in lavorazione;\n\nriporta separatamente gli eventuali storni\/rivalse su provvigioni di\npratiche erogate in periodi precedenti.\n\nL'esito (numero di pratiche importate, o l'errore riscontrato) compare in una\nnotifica a fine operazione. I dati importati sono consultabili in sola lettura\nin \"OAM Dettaglio\" (riga per riga) e vengono riepilogati in \"Semestrale OAM\"\n(aggregati per istituto e prodotto).\n\n4","embedding":[-0.0043076198,0.032315344,-0.009483367,-0.02002284,-0.0010847088,-0.006840198,0.0017487094,-0.0058397204,-0.019587763,-0.054168835,0.00049113546,0.031932358,0.01439345,-0.00056992675,0.0006474976,0.0044492017,0.010493997,-0.0053161792,-0.0009807112,-0.02831977,-0.007434566,-0.0032991082,0.008230353,0.0069680703,0.009888266,0.012921513,0.0110287005,-0.018432193,-0.021185692,0.09380871,0.0060342886,0.0033591157,0.0019819317,-0.029169379,0.0077999113,0.0031180615,-0.0127269635,-0.015557316,-0.0012225616,-0.02453885,0.0030944925,-0.009348385,-0.0039502163,0.008681064,0.003919547,0.009431375,-0.0030962548,0.0073257773,0.01726703,0.005398474,0.03140244,0.018914806,-0.023410732,0.010917788,0.0072355303,0.026164459,-0.0049306094,-0.014529592,0.0328702,0.028240804,-0.0025331797,-0.010503676,0.0032677692,0.018224316,-0.012689618,0.004277111,0.013719628,-0.03683997,0.014105559,0.007417645,-0.008360681,-0.000668524,0.0096743535,0.029490465,-0.008537401,-0.005056281,-0.04486555,0.00541615,0.0021140072,0.0