\/www\/html\/unicooam\/resources\/manuals\/manuale-operativo-oam.html","score":0,"metadata":[]}
{"id":"644ae1e4-a579-433b-ac3f-9895b5e6b012","content":" Relazione semestrale OAM (M510)\n\nLa sezione Semestrale OAM mostra l'aggregato del periodo\n(pratiche intermediate, erogato, provvigioni, storni, ripartiti per istituto e\nprodotto creditizio) ed \u00e8 il punto da cui si genera il file da inviare all'OAM.\n\nDalla pagina elenco, i pulsanti di esportazione producono un file Excel\nmulti-foglio con la struttura richiesta dal modello M510:\n\nFoglioContenuto\n\nAnagraficaDati della societ\u00e0 (\u00a72 \"Azienda\").\n\nProfilo economico basePratiche intermediate\/in lavorazione, erogato, provvigioni per prodotto (dalla Semestrale OAM aggregata).\n\nProfilo prudenzialeReclami e segnalazioni SOS del semestre, audit\/ispezioni effettuati e relativi rilievi (\u00a75, \u00a76, \u00a77).\n\nProfilo informativoSiti web, procedure e modulistica pubblicate, funzioni esternalizzate.\n\nElenco sedi territorialiSedi operative (\u00a72 \"Sedi\")","embedding":[-0.0034113554,0.028184569,-0.0135997925,-0.012581312,-0.00023006216,0.0023536074,0.00671096,-0.016688311,-0.0122737065,-0.0382271,-0.0018743745,0.02175108,0.009305903,-0.0014056748,-0.0006048199,0.00320549,0.015193805,0.012222212,0.0072415676,-0.02101707,0.003160334,0.007176951,-0.002296216,0.004883118,0.0016025939,0.011753775,0.00397003,-0.02175127,-0.008385818,0.12264601,0.008843784,-0.0006270977,0.0014547135,-0.008494682,0.015782114,-0.0017583837,-0.027433626,-0.0054575773,0.009692753,-0.019678304,-0.011395905,0.017861426,0.00760085,0.009994264,0.016564045,0.009297948,-0.001968124,0.00631524,0.011346342,-0.0034640795,0.025511637,0.011419678,0.008409487,0.009953543,0.006028525,0.020521456,-0.007802515,0.0012572296,0.011302614,0.039321855,0.012782361,-0.00076255325,0.013510256,-0.0024185416,-0.012627195,-0.0017125055,0.01299201,-0.026622074,0.0024699855,0.00916818,0.0021918407,0.013457433,0.016210243,0.014312484,-0.00789132,-0.008794189,-0.020753324,0.020611815,0.004084308,0.015084449,-0.014197455,-0.023664158,-0.011