{"id":"c48df826-e2f0-4727-9889-a1684eda4e8f","content":"\n\nIl pulsante \"Completo\" genera il file con tutti i fogli in una\nsola cartella di lavoro; i pulsanti \"Analitico\", \"Anagrafica\", \"Informativo\",\n\"Sedi\", \"Prudenziale\" generano il singolo foglio isolato, utile per verificare\nun dato prima dell'invio ufficiale.\n\nPrima di esportare la relazione, verificare di aver eseguito l'importazione del\nperiodo corretto (\u00a73) e che anagrafica azienda, sedi e siti web siano\naggiornati: l'esportazione fotografa i dati presenti in quel momento, non li\nricalcola.\n\n5. Audit interni e rilievi\n\nLa sezione Audit \u00e8 il registro dei controlli periodici,\ndocumentali o in loco, svolti sulla rete (dipendenti, agenti, sedi). Ogni audit\nha:\n\nun soggetto controllato e, se richiesto da un ente esterno\n(es","embedding":[0.0063542766,0.036870424,0.00875728,-0.01571695,0.012589902,0.0003967288,0.015072984,-0.012791511,-0.004438436,-0.050299995,-0.010133309,0.03147565,0.016369201,-0.014763479,-0.0020605833,-0.020253727,0.002420076,0.00045125623,0.002534241,-0.019891512,-0.02264551,-0.00249828,-0.006121969,0.009417069,-0.00011418408,0.015030506,0.0032529084,-0.029987862,-0.013324767,0.08580748,0.0020851118,-0.02643639,0.0255143,-0.013137893,0.0030414083,0.0015232575,-0.007478181,-0.011104858,0.0032981688,-0.021924011,0.0043343394,-0.02272602,2.5686772e-6,-0.012964298,-0.004346019,0.0005756053,0.0043958626,-0.0013345182,-0.005098023,0.014882494,0.04000923,0.0077488665,0.005108867,0.004557616,-0.01188829,0.0104070185,-0.013764624,0.0010019979,0.028588342,0.022047061,-0.00030907497,-0.004925542,-0.0025994526,0.014952645,0.01331751,0.0052463943,0.021752695,-0.015080024,0.01403337,-0.0037131277,0.0027661438,0.010566632,0.012101839,0.017757824,-0.02581603,-0.020857345,-0.05600846,0.0050736135,-0.0069764177,0.025690455,-0.007118617,-0.023689147,-0.009202695,-0.0021989828,-0.029032571,0.006364458,-0.0069422433,-0.012708919,0.0036710757,0.020996511,-0.012915136,0.015961