{"id":"12afe74b-9d65-475e-ae04-6e680a7812fa","content":" la stessa OAM), l'organismo di riferimento (\u00a710);\n\nuna modalit\u00e0 di esecuzione (documentale, audit, ispezione) e le date di\nprogrammazione ed esecuzione;\n\nun numero di protocollo, assegnato automaticamente in\nsequenza per anno (formato AAAA\/NNNN) se lasciato vuoto;\n\nun esito (conforme \/ non conforme) e, se non conforme, un piano di rimedio e\nuna data di follow-up.\n\nSe dall'audit emergono criticit\u00e0 puntuali, si aprono uno o pi\u00f9\nrilievi (scheda \"Rilievi audit\", accessibile dal dettaglio\ndell'audit): ciascun rilievo ha una gravit\u00e0 (osservazione, minore, maggiore,\ncritica), uno stato (aperto, in lavorazione, risolto, rischio accettato,\nchiuso), pu\u00f2 richiedere un approfondimento e\/o un'azione correttiva con\nscadenza propria. La dashboard segnala nel riquadro \"Audit in corso\" quanti\nrilievi sono ancora aperti o in lavorazione","embedding":[-0.024228293,0.012238136,0.023657946,0.0008898101,0.021369684,-0.014925312,0.02053655,-0.0052033598,0.009671857,-0.04378015,-0.010834065,0.008004649,0.014239634,0.00044535694,0.018749967,0.0064724567,-0.0016567956,-0.0049928585,0.013316184,-0.005148313,-0.011352076,0.016157422,0.01176303,-0.00027908073,-0.012767412,0.013597289,0.018166095,-0.007889019,-0.019690862,0.11465511,-0.013324565,-0.008108655,0.011623218,-0.018561738,-0.0068018674,-0.014874193,-0.025427062,-0.008522719,0.012581456,-0.013191774,0.0065683885,-0.018369399,0.017952222,0.004715089,-0.010443389,-0.007365469,0.025265288,0.015185401,-0.0010422859,0.008080691,0.032473456,-0.010751219,0.019490084,0.022502663,0.0036552048,0.005947952,0.004321628,0.006375517,0.0093107475,0.0065250504,-0.0027789415,-0.009354992,-0.002642811,0.0074638366,0.0036327092,-0.013399874,0.018796215,-0.001003422,0.020919934,0.01938808,0.013093177,0.0097668655,0.0053659645,-0.016958002,-0.009496803,-0.014028516,-0.0322272,0.014579229,-0.013438123,0.020191628,-0.016449776,-0.009547324,-0.018988