{"id":"9b5e5ecc-5ce7-4a65-9051-06f722ab82f7","content":" La\nscadenza di gestione viene impostata alla creazione (45 giorni\ndalla ricezione, come da regolamento reclami) e, se il termine \u00e8 superato senza\nche il reclamo risulti accolto o respinto, il record compare come scaduto nella\ndashboard (\"Reclami in corso\").\n\n7. Segnalazioni operazioni sospette (SOS)\n\nLa sezione Segnalazioni SOS \u00e8 il registro interno delle\noperazioni ritenute sospette ai fini antiriciclaggio, propedeutico\nall'eventuale segnalazione alla UIF. Per ciascuna segnalazione si registra: il\ncliente interessato, chi ha segnalato l'anomalia (dipendente o agente),\nla data, i codici anomalia rilevati, una descrizione dei fatti e lo stato\n(bozza, in valutazione, segnalata, archiviata).\n\nQuesta sezione contiene informazioni riservate per legge: va trattata con la\nmassima cautela, condivisa solo con chi ha necessit\u00e0 di conoscerla (referente\nantiriciclaggio, compliance), mai discussa con il cliente segnalato n\u00e9 citata\nper esteso fuori dall'applicativo.\n\n8","embedding":[0.0011919067,0.018031107,0.020855825,0.001355647,0.010118529,-0.0043254965,0.023187447,-0.009003511,0.0012363787,-0.030995402,-0.029851306,0.032326583,0.008871952,-0.021603335,0.022028282,-0.03881436,0.0071325637,-0.006891707,-0.0032650197,-0.014192003,-0.03354453,0.019424872,-0.006490848,0.010843106,-0.013447862,0.027107129,0.007841699,-0.018872742,-0.0099798255,0.10722354,0.0022219568,-0.0187373,0.0034781147,-0.0073006516,-0.016949188,-0.01296229,-0.027208395,0.0067867306,1.7041517e-5,-0.024841497,0.0072618863,-0.015451247,0.017871484,-0.016424753,-0.0013590148,0.0029405153,-0.0017937958,-0.0052519245,-0.015944794,0.0021883578,0.024099397,0.0024708807,0.0019086599,0.030582814,-0.0040605464,0.019409193,0.027607389,0.005417043,0.025106378,0.010250775,0.011162659,0.00036609784,0.0015211466,0.011346933,0.0060974564,-0.015031341,0.015609131,-0.0042537777,0.019628152,0.0010582769,0.0017562665,0.03939701,0.01