{"id":"4879609f-1081-44b6-a52e-937f0d3820f0","content":" Documenti e scadenzario\n\nOgni documento caricato in UnicoOAM (allegato a un dipendente, una sede, una\npratica, un audit, un reclamo.) \u00e8 un record nella sezione Elenco\nDocumenti, con: tipo documento, data di emissione e di scadenza, stato\n(richiesto, caricato, approvato, respinto, provvisorio, scaduto, non\nleggibile, revocato, non applicabile), ed eventuali note interne.\n\nI Tipi Documento (menu System) definiscono, per ciascuna\ntipologia (es. \"Iscrizione OAM\", \"Visura camerale\", \"Documento d'identit\u00e0\"): a\nchi si pu\u00f2 associare (dipendente, agente, cliente, azienda, pratica.), se va\nmonitorato per la scadenza, la durata di validit\u00e0 e con quanto anticipo\navvisare (giorni di preavviso).\n\nI documenti marcati \"monitorato\" e con una scadenza compaiono nello\nScadenziario","embedding":[0.013083761,0.019709101,0.013965658,0.004309229,0.0037470395,-0.007089713,0.007379601,0.00013960883,0.010651672,-0.044944577,0.0030473168,0.018378248,-0.011155517,0.0064406446,0.03165779,-0.021800485,0.013979055,0.0052225795,-0.0030820256,-0.007379714,-0.030330205,0.004703908,0.0011857129,0.008443551,-0.010974947,0.04405693,0.003774244,-0.00563827,-0.025981475,0.10449755,0.013604419,-0.022320876,0.004531133,-0.0340118,-0.0049388073,0.0067331265,-0.041360486,-0.0051356703,0.018584747,-0.003721818,-0.0076334556,0.00911523,-0.0023861788,-0.0004015362,-0.0081375595,0.0049600066,0.00071620004,0.004767102,0.011054072,0.004025992,0.047565807,0.008822094,0.0014225765,0.011969514,-0.020601401,0.007080576,0.00730849,0.0063154264,0.03544256,0.01517945,0.015846116,-0.019003604,0.0056673456,0.0046987263,-0.014592658,0.0049613765,0.01957769,0.0022454527,0.01442061,-0.004993635,-0.011241683,0.040042292,0.0161144,0.008202776,-0.01797439,-0.004067999,-0.028648926,0.016941754,-0.00944532,0.01568318,-0.014306166,-0.0072795693,-0.028479014,-0.0070198406,-0.015903678,-0.0054145562,-0.012953153,-0.028273908,0.00143835