{"id":"9886efbd-efc9-4dfc-977b-e644696f98f3","content":" Un job programmato (documents:send-reminders,\nogni giorno alle 8:00) invia automaticamente un promemoria via email al\nreferente competente man mano che ci si avvicina alla scadenza (secondo le\nsoglie configurate sul tipo documento), e registra ogni invio per non\nsollecitare due volte la stessa scadenza a distanza di pochi giorni. La\ndashboard mostra in \"Documenti scaduti\" quelli monitorati gi\u00e0 oltre la data di\nscadenza, con collegamento diretto allo scadenzario.\n\nIl download di un allegato richiede sempre di essere autenticati\nnell'applicativo: un link al singolo file non \u00e8 mai accessibile pubblicamente.\n\n9. Modelli email e plichi documentali\n\nModelli email (menu System) sono i testi standard usati dai\npromemoria automatici e da altre comunicazioni: contengono segnaposto (es.\n{agente_nome}, {documento_nome}, {elenco_documenti})\nsostituiti automaticamente con i dati reali al momento dell'invio","embedding":[-0.0030638655,0.0018982295,0.035375137,0.0066873496,0.010579121,-0.003934235,0.01696915,0.005390114,0.018606503,-0.037523247,-0.02447056,0.03067583,-0.010133818,-0.006502299,0.008678543,-0.025300918,-0.0071544065,-0.017845655,-0.02411662,-0.01584659,-0.05455334,0.011531324,0.0030363046,0.026547555,-0.020679941,0.051865052,0.0042097652,-0.002689692,-0.019187653,0.09246225,-0.0002384003,-0.034989297,0.011341306,-0.025056029,-0.0041850014,-0.0012604443,-0.028210672,0.004397078,0.007366341,0.00059855456,0.003772716,0.008292802,-0.005444517,-0.018660644,0.00060895993,-0.0035101771,-0.00940681,0.00397981,0.0069037965,0.0038105538,0.033100322,0.0047012246,0.016489383,0.0046675834,-0.020955205,-0.0042331973,0.015342253,-0.0052674026,0.032251883,0.006589459,0.014735245,-0.020741617,0.007313502,0.0022909988,-0.019944806,-0.0025417472,0.020572832,0.0121208755,0.01436433,-0.0114433,0.015570849,0.04816487,0.013425971,0.004038627,-0.0268576,-0.017477619,-0.040696975,0.025049113,-0.027699573,0.0