{"id":"112e0e5e-d408-43c3-88d6-d9913362c51e","content":"\n\nPlico documentale \u00e8 l'elenco di documenti richiesti in blocco\nper completare una pratica o un onboarding (es. tutti i documenti necessari per\nattivare un nuovo collaboratore): raggruppa pi\u00f9 Tipi Documento in un'unica\nchecklist da seguire fino al completamento.\n\n10. Organismi di vigilanza e piani di rimedio\n\nOrganismi (menu System) \u00e8 l'anagrafica degli enti esterni che\npossono richiedere o disporre un controllo (OAM, IVASS, altri organismi di\nvigilanza): si collega agli Audit quando il controllo non \u00e8 di iniziativa\ninterna.\n\nPiani di rimedio raccoglie le azioni correttive strutturate\naperte a seguito di un audit non conforme o di un rilievo importante, con\nresponsabile e scadenza, per tenere traccia della loro chiusura nel tempo.\n\n11. Utenti, ruoli e permessi\n\nOltre al ruolo generale dell'utente (\u00a71), l'accesso alle singole sezioni pu\u00f2\nessere affinato con il motore di permessi basato su:\n\nModuli (menu System, sezione \"Moduli\"): il catalogo delle\nrisorse gestibili (es","embedding":[0.0012238552,0.033723418,0.026884094,-0.0026785987,0.006204135,-0.013448698,0.030700166,-0.005159092,0.017198337,-0.060224373,-0.008397008,0.01954492,0.0097023975,-0.005499857,0.02862098,-0.021025557,-0.0017215181,-0.002501781,-0.003991277,0.0017887417,-0.03728136,0.006121365,0.0070963427,0.025034495,-0.017726067,0.016811367,0.022156773,-0.011268797,-0.03669104,0.08310805,-0.0019159985,-0.032397963,0.019222641,-0.004934584,-0.015370979,0.00025905936,-0.026012221,-0.00010849477,0.008436493,-0.012302467,-0.0016808817,-0.0118434755,0.01643401,-0.0051256297,-0.0061227344,0.001344224,0.004701756,0.004811641,-0.005699403,0.017919881,0.031800054,0.012465833,-0.0047211507,0.021835968,-0.011600354,-0.016716003,-0.018889524,0.0070942035,0.029002145,0.020191284,0.019482749,0.00074280665,-0.008192658,0.0072052693,-0.015279312,-0.0026501126,0.016271153,-0.010580819,0.023890967,-0.021397475,-