{"id":"5051e163-c584-4c6b-9d4d-eb16a9c34f2e","content":" \"Audit\", \"Registro Reclami\", \"Dipendenti\".), ciascuna\ncon un piano minimo richiesto;\n\nRuoli (tipi di collaboratore, es. \"Responsabile\nCompliance\", \"Backoffice\"): per ciascun ruolo si definisce, modulo per modulo,\nquali azioni sono permesse (elenco, dettaglio, creazione, modifica,\neliminazione) tramite una matrice di interruttori nella scheda del ruolo;\n\nogni collaboratore (\u00a72 \"Organigramma\") viene poi associato a uno o pi\u00f9\nruoli, ereditandone i permessi.\n\nChi non ha il permesso su un modulo non lo vede nel menu e non pu\u00f2 aprirne le\npagine nemmeno digitando l'indirizzo a mano.\n\n12","embedding":[-0.029085679,-0.0012731629,0.0066202655,-0.0038404681,0.008199257,-0.018326357,0.029258367,-0.004388081,0.016352218,-0.036561575,-0.04163235,0.021509256,0.010600207,0.0061753956,0.025794731,-0.02685343,-0.008101693,-0.004299898,-0.0123649435,-0.007953717,-0.019977292,0.021195676,0.007112341,0.02388381,-0.023600355,0.008827908,0.02560496,0.0013519205,-0.037487675,0.10771311,-0.0087719355,-0.021480793,0.0074016545,0.013776903,0.0040281233,0.0011111902,-0.020954521,0.0044244705,0.0072210156,-0.0048937486,-0.000956074,-0.0033237163,-0.007228029,-0.006867057,-0.00041320958,0.004624186,-0.00698813,0.00970871,-0.006370924,0.0009830148,0.015663082,0.0032215877,0.010693798,0.013187993,-0.0071280194,-0.0001955689,-0.0039963652,0.018226925,0.044943843,0.022110075,0.01106592,-0.0144575685,0.0068424237,0.007823565,0.0076668374,-0.0011250674,0.020846749,0.0016079657,0.008261948,-0.004926599,-0.0077291834,0.04420455,0.021252347,0.0017750981,-0.015857685,-0.0046364744,-0.018810099,0.013143275,-0.006290919,0.009497504,-0.020838618,-0.02026855,-0.011914219,-0.0037264584,-0.022884505,0.0015164433,-0.012022803,-0.024894526,0.011022421,0.027197469,-0.015023699,0.0033447137,0.035151795,-0.016465329,-0.038315956,-0.015149899,-0.00997206,-0.024199888,-0.010356764,0.027147155,0.015580035,-0.00010172738,0.