{"id":"77853c90-08c4-4e80-8edf-65dcb9a1d109","content":" Assistente AI\n\nLa voce di menu \"Assistente AI\" permette di fare due tipi di\ndomande:\n\ndomande procedurali (\"come si registra un reclamo?\", \"dove\nsi trova lo scadenzario documenti?\"): la risposta viene cercata in questo\nmanuale;\n\ndomande sui dati operativi (\"quante pratiche OAM in\nlavorazione ci sono questo semestre?\", \"quali documenti scadono questo mese?\"):\nl'assistente interroga il database in sola lettura, limitatamente alle tabelle\ndi dominio (mai credenziali, password o token).\n\nSe la risposta non \u00e8 quella cercata, il pulsante \"Non \u00e8 la risposta\nche cercavo, contatta il supporto\" invia una email al supporto con la\ndomanda posta e la risposta ricevuta, in copia anche all'utente che l'ha\nrichiesta.\n\n13. Glossario\n\nTermineSignificato\n\nOAMOrganismo degli Agenti e dei Mediatori: l'ente di vigilanza a cui la societ\u00e0 \u00e8 iscritta.\n\nM510Il modello di relazione semestrale richiesto dall'OAM","embedding":[-0.007037565,0.0076161567,0.0018283098,0.009099609,0.007987683,0.008162551,0.025058212,-0.003907977,-0.009089744,-0.04443948,-0.011344183,0.03429955,0.0042335386,-0.011855029,0.007131222,-0.012194807,0.030857703,-0.0046521416,0.006903443,-0.008671,-0.027316574,0.02370398,-0.01144997,0.027377378,-0.017975733,0.029021949,0.014740065,-0.0024084717,-0.0211979,0.11735275,-0.00012010873,-0.009531451,0.008862267,-0.017778885,-0.0035892953,-0.0124821905,-0.013003919,-0.0010915888,0.0023981337,-0.023578968,-0.0066993283,0.007915842,0.025727542,0.012288215,0.005934052,0.012562717,-0.004423299,-0.0033710904,0.021844251,-0.00012247928,0.024164068,0.022465058,-0.018505182,0.015109787,0.0049753883,-0.00013218595,0.008913484,-0.0051505584,0.0173715,0.02422798,0.0022433735,-0.0077665513,0.0034624522,0.007475233,-0.011580001,4.3623088e-5,0.009243326,-0.009499764,0.019133154,0.0030347495,-0.018681059,0.016760249,0.039099906,0.011804499,-0.02806964,-0.0013838599,-0.02878151,0.01