{"id":"b5237839-472a-41d1-9b9d-f8aa0126f670","content":"\n\nProformaIl gestionale esterno, sullo stesso server MySQL, da cui vengono importate pratiche e provvigioni (in sola lettura).\n\nPraticaUn'operazione di finanziamento seguita da un agente\/collaboratore per conto di un cliente presso un istituto erogante.\n\nErogatoL'importo effettivamente liquidato dall'istituto su una pratica.\n\nStorno \/ rivalsaRestituzione, totale o parziale, di una provvigione gi\u00e0 percepita su una pratica successivamente estinta o annullata.\n\nSOSSegnalazione di Operazione Sospetta ai fini antiriciclaggio.\n\nRUIRegistro Unico degli Intermediari assicurativi (competenza IVASS), quando la societ\u00e0 opera anche in ambito assicurativo","embedding":[0.0034244359,0.018267887,0.003195006,0.000534859,0.0017925295,-0.0045288946,-0.00505932,-0.0064309756,-0.009831253,-0.048669364,-0.022254396,0.029186275,0.0028900353,-0.013178447,0.0050038104,-0.028403748,0.0006859708,0.016640423,-0.00072730274,-0.010879494,-0.033817474,0.0053508533,0.0025086675,-0.012205219,-0.013354589,0.030415032,0.0045805243,-0.014070137,0.0014725743,0.11257607,0.013512857,-0.0037130064,-0.005001418,-0.022218341,-0.0035630534,0.0064547653,-0.01244671,-0.011175804,-0.00424457,-0.022866422,0.0023506058,-0.0049441103,0.0020645976,-0.0021547796,0.02567351,0.005456765,-0.016535852,-0.009587134,-0.004724785,-0.005004548,0.023957523,0.035003215,-0.020393612,0.006218633,0.01513243,0.012641137,-0.0031559456,0.00038384998,0.009806661,-0.0057967342,-0.00096951734,0.008289231,0.002751483,0.026313834,-0.018917419,0.0038001009,0.010618736,-0.022850879,0.03684465,-0.006535733,-0.018379653,0.030515585,0.0030091594,0.008787601,-0.008124909,-0.0147964675,0.00881218,0.007153534,0.004086552,0.023720989,-0.010307883,-0.0026536144,-0.021521335,-0.028682914,0.0018081268,0.0031283807,-0.00663949,-0.0070982086,0.009466543,0.018352203,-0.013941962,0.017013308,0.021159353,-0.017205622,-0.03846638,0.011830874,-0.009213983,-0.010934919,-0.0110